External-review findings F1-F8 on the deferral: transient children follow the
view home when it leaves the drag tree; the drag tree's stacking is restored
only when the view actually leaves it (pinned/floating-over-fullscreen stay
visible through the settle); the settle apply restacks floating views and syncs
presentation; the release's say over the resting tree ends with the release
handler; the unmap landing uses a fresh homeTree(); the overview flushes
deferred re-homes synchronously; attach() supersedes the wait. The check gains
displacement floors on every sample and asserts the transfer settle clip.

Validated: units 142/142; full harness 386 pass — the 7 failures reproduce on
pristine 77ec5ae6 (5) or pass in isolation (2 load flakes); clang-format clean.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
(cherry picked from commit 7ac93ec1e223dd44a9e9476340ea0c0584f0c214)
